      "extract": "SM prediction [31–50], which points towards NP of the order of the SM EW contribution. The main theory uncertainty comes from hadronic vacuum polarization (HVP). Here, the Budapest Marseilles Wuppertal collaboration (BMWc) released ﬁrst lattice results that indicate a value in tension with the one derived from e+e−data [35–40]. Therefore, future detailed comparisons with other lattice calculations will be necessary",
